{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502310/extras/S_P_GIF2.gif?t=1745352808\" />SYNCO PATH is a first-person psychological horror experience set in the mysterious Global Psychometric Assessment Program.\u00a0After a jaywalking incident turns violent, You wake up in an isolated prison cell with a chilling sentence: death in 17 days unless you can recall the name of the man who witnessed your arrest. <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502310/extras/S_P_GIF3.gif?t=1745352808\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a maze of industrial nightmares and endure isolation in a quest to uncover the truth hidden within your own insecurities. What could be more terrifying than being alone?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502310/extras/S_P_GIF4.gif?t=1745352808\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your wits and tools to unravel the complex mystery that lies at the root of your occupancy. In this austere prison only one name matters.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502310/extras/S_P_GIF6.gif?t=1745352808\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Remember, reality is far more than what the mind perceives.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502310/extras/S_P_GIF5.gif?t=1745352808\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And no one is ever truly alone...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502310/extras/S_P_GIF7.gif?t=1745352808\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/